      "text": "Attacker accounting: migration replaces two powered trips plus one hand trip with nine hand trips occupying the transfer clerk from 2 through 11. It eliminates charge use but retains rack, counting surface and timed dispatch dependence. Inspection still occupies thirteen minutes, consumes twelve seals and the spare bracket. Clock/ledger maintenance contributes zero modeled labor; no physical maintenance saving is established."
