      ],
      "text": "Finite replay defeats a labor-advantage prediction: both proposed schedules release twelve correct carriers at 13 without waits. Manual transfer occupies nine minutes; trolley B4-B7 at 0-3, trolley B8-B11 at 3-6 and hand B12 at 6-7 occupy seven. Rival rack peak is five versus manual three. Thus lower charge dependence and rack occupancy survive, while migration loses the fixed ranking. These are calculated predictions, not observed trials."
