      ],
      "text": "Distinct constructive attack: replay permitted boundary idling by shifting every manual start one minute later. Calculation exposes inspection idling at 3-4 and only eleven releases by 13. This tests dependence on early dispatch; it does not establish that delay occurs. Exact proposed timing produces neither starvation nor blocking, refuting that attack against the unchanged schedule."
