      "text": "Surviving action: hand carry B4 starting at 2 and B5-B12 starting at 3-10; inspect continuously from 0. Finite replay predicts nine source unloads by 11, B9 corrected and sealed at 10, and twelve correct releases at 13. Transfer burden is nine minutes; inspection burden thirteen. No waits occur, rack peak is three, and no trolley charge is consumed. The new dependency is timely manual dispatch plus the existing rack and counting surface."
